    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d281-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d281-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, S/S–NSC Files: Lot 63 D 351, NSC 5503 Series. Top
                    Secret. Copies were also sent to the Secretary of the Treasury, the Director of
                    the Bureau of the Budget, the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff, and the
                    Director of Central Intelligence.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d281-f2" n="2" xml:id="d281-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="frus1955-57v02#d12">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>,
